cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below, and cite the upstream data sources listed in LICENSE-data."
title: "Bay Area Smoke Trends"
abstract: >-
  A public, reproducible visualization of wildfire smoke and PM2.5 in the
  California Bay Area over time, designed to answer the practical question of
  how likely smoke is on a given calendar date at a given location -- for
  planning outdoor events.
type: software
authors:
